  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.4.9\n        - G9ChipGroup: LayoutMode.Segmented - one row (or SegmentColumns per row) of equal, flat cells: resting grey on a hairline, the chosen one tinted in the accent with an accent outline and bold text, no checkmark (AgriPad task priority, sort and filter sheets).\n        - G9RangeSlider: Logarithmic (a track by ratio, for ranges over orders of magnitude) and ShowThumbValues (each thumb's value above it, always).\n        - Outlined fields: AlwaysFloat with a Label and a Placeholder draws the placeholder inside the empty box; PlaceholderInside makes the placeholder a plain inner hint that never floats.\n        - G9BottomSheetToolbarItem.BadgeText / G9HeaderActionButton.BadgeText: a count pill on a header action (the active filters).\n\n        Earlier versions: https://github.com/ImanKari/G9MAUIControls/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
